From 3086562d5a213e998cacfe1739a0df9d5ec15083 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: retropineaple <118107729+retropineaple@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 09:50:19 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 03/54] Experimental ADL-P internal panel as fixed Combo A DP
 (-wex-adlp-edp)

Opt-in route for mobile Display13 laptops whose eDP panel sits on Combo A:
- VBT: keep the first child per DDI (Linux semantics) and prefer DDI A
  as the panel when the firmware describes internal DP on A and B.
- Wiring: admit Combo A fixed DP and rewrite the donor panel record to
  the fixed Combo DP record; strict upstream behaviour is unchanged.
- Install the shared training lease adapter and DPBoot13 contract for
  Combo-only DP using the provider's Combo DP probe capability.
- Fix Combo TRANS_CLK_SEL (DDI+1) and lease-stop checks for Combo DDIs.
- Boot handoff checks the whole firmware surface, not an FHD-sized prefix.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
